136	  /**
137	   * Folds over the non-null ranges of the nullIndexIterator using the reducer.
138	   * @param nullIndexIterator an int iterator that returns values in ascending order whose min value is 0.
139	   *                          Rows are considered null if and only if their index is emitted.
